        "description": "Kuroe has been suffering from a mysterious illness for at least sixteen years that causes abnormal body growth and disfigurement. This has led Kuroe to become an outcast feeling that nobody could accept someone like her. She has a pet dog named \"[Jumbo King](https://anilist.co/character/383266/Jumbo-King)\".",
