        "description": "\nArata is a popular guy in [Kuroe's](https://anilist.co/character/138874/Akashi-Kuroe) school who starts getting model offerings. He takes interest in Kuroe, revealing that he too wants to be out of the spotlight, and lost a lot of weight to become the person he is known as. This quickly irritates the other jealous school girls crushing on him who cannot understand what he sees in Kuroe.",
